      "decay_ic_3d": 0.025116,
      "decay_ic_5d": 0.031540,
      "decay_ic_10d": 0.008938
    },
    "regime_notes": "Strong in 2020-2022 (IC 0.077315, ICIR 0.213772), passes narrowly in 2023-2025 (IC 0.028360, ICIR 0.087243), but negative in sparse 2026-2031 observations (IC -0.013179, ICIR -0.036374). Treat as a sparse conditional overlay and monitor drift conservatively.",
    "signal_artifact": "scripts/miner_1_20320205_volume_shock_reversal_signal.csv",
